  "details": "Small QoL thing that is likely already tracked internally, but to be safe...\nDuring the process of creating a new project, the 'Project Name' prompt doesn't allow you to add any spaces to your project name.\nYou can add spaces to the project folder in Explorer after creation, but VCC will then flag it as an invalid project + remove it from the list (easy enough to just re-add, at least!)",
